# Process many issues hands-off in a row

Run this to **process a queue of issues hands-off** with a single up-front confirmation — the batch equivalent of `/iflow-yolo`. Each issue runs the full yolo chain (`init → plan → start → close yolo`, PR auto-merged); the cycle interrupts you only when input is **strictly necessary**.

Use only when every queued issue is genuinely yolo-fit (small, low-risk, well-specified, test-guarded).

